Subject: [PATCH 3/3] cpu_common: hold CPU boost while the GPU is saturated
 (Mali gpu_busy >= 95%)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/cpu_common/gpu_guard.rs | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/cpu_common/mod.rs       |  9 +++++
 2 files changed, 81 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/cpu_common/gpu_guard.rs

